@HD	VN:1.6	SO:unsorted
@SQ	SN:chr1	LN:40
@SQ	SN:chrX	LN:40
@CO	0-based    0         1         2         3
@CO	           0123456789012345678901234567890123456789
@CO	chr1       ACGTTGCAAGGCCTTAGCATGCAATCGGATCCTAGGCTAA
@CO	ok: ordinary 8M at 20, for comparison.
@CO	unmapped: FLAG 4, no position -> one all-NULL row (dropped by --only-hits).
@CO	unmapped_placed: FLAG 4 with RNAME/POS -> same as unmapped.
@CO	cigar_star: FLAG 0 but CIGAR '*' -> htslib marks it unmapped on read (samtools warns) -> NULL row.
@CO	iupac: SEQ with N, R, Y -> emitted as-is and matched as sets.
@CO	eq_in_seq: SEQ 'G=AATCGG' -> the '=' base is the empty set: its column exists but no pattern, not even ~, matches it.
@CO	qual_star: QUAL '*' -> qual is 255 on every read base (not NULL).
@CO	off_reference: on chrX, which ref.fa lacks -> run stops unless --permissive; then an all-NULL row.
@CO	seq_star.sam (separate file): mapped 8M with SEQ '*' -> skipped and counted (given a null row).
ok	0	chr1	21	60	8M	*	0	0	GCAATCGG	+,-./012
unmapped	4	*	0	0	*	*	0	0	GCAATCGG	+,-./012
unmapped_placed	4	chr1	21	60	*	*	0	0	GCAATCGG	+,-./012
cigar_star	0	chr1	21	60	*	*	0	0	GCAATCGG	+,-./012
iupac	0	chr1	21	60	8M	*	0	0	GNRATYGG	+,-./012
